<% content_for :title, "Review transaction" %>
<div class="bw-page-heading"><div><span class="bw-eyebrow">MAKE THE DETAILS YOURS</span><h1>Review transaction.</h1><p>Keep your records accurate and mark anything that needs a closer look.</p></div><%= link_to "← Back to transactions", finance_transactions_path, class: "bw-text-link" %></div>
<div class="bw-two-column"><section class="bw-panel"><div class="bw-transaction-summary"><span class="bw-transaction-icon"><%= finance_icon "transactions", size: 22 %></span><div><strong><%= @transaction.description %></strong><span><%= finance_date(@transaction.booked_on) %></span></div><strong class="bw-summary-amount <%= 'bw-positive' if @transaction.amount.positive? %>"><%= finance_money(@transaction.amount, @profile.currency) %></strong></div><% if @transaction.errors.any? %><div class="bw-flash bw-flash-error" role="alert"><%= @transaction.errors.full_messages.to_sentence %></div><% end %><%= form_with model: @transaction, url: finance_transaction_path(@transaction), method: :patch, scope: :finance_transaction, data: {turbo: false}, class: "bw-form" do |form| %><div class="bw-field"><%= form.label :description, "Description" %><%= form.text_field :description, required: true, maxlength: 500 %></div><div class="bw-field"><%= form.label :category, "Category" %><%= form.select :category, @categories %><small>Auto-assigned categories are a starting point. You can change them here.</small></div><label class="bw-checkbox-card"><%= form.check_box :tax_review %><span><strong>Flag for tax review</strong><small>Include this transaction in the records you review with your tax professional.</small></span></label><label class="bw-checkbox-card"><%= form.check_box :excluded %><span><strong>Exclude from totals and forecasts</strong><small>Use for duplicates or items that should not affect your financial picture.</small></span></label><div class="bw-form-footer"><%= link_to "Cancel", finance_transactions_path, class: "bw-text-link" %><%= form.submit "Save changes", class: "bw-button bw-button-dark" %></div><% end %></section><aside class="bw-panel bw-panel-soft"><span class="bw-feature-icon"><%= finance_icon "file", size: 26 %></span><h2>A useful record,<br>not a tax decision.</h2><p>Flagging a transaction does not make it deductible. Save receipts and supporting documents, and confirm the applicable treatment for your jurisdiction.</p><p class="bw-caption">The original date and amount stay tied to the imported statement. Remove and re-import a corrected file if those values need to change.</p></aside></div>
